                <invention-title lang="de">VIDEODATENSTROM, VIDEOCODIERER, VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN ZUR FESTLEGUNG VON HRD-TIMINGS UND WEITERE ZUSÄTZE FÜR SKALIERBARE UND ZUSAMMENFÜGBARE BITSTRÖME</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">FLUX DE DONNÉES VIDÉO, CODEUR VIDÉO, APPAREIL ET PROCÉDÉS POUR DES FIXATIONS TEMPORELLES HRD, ET AJOUTS SUPPLÉMENTAIRES POUR DES FLUX BINAIRES EXTENSIBLES ET FUSIBLES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VIDEO DATA STREAM, VIDEO ENCODER, APPARATUS AND METHODS FOR HRD TIMING FIXES, AND FURTHER ADDITIONS FOR SCALABLE AND MERGEABLE BITSTREAMS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A video data stream having a video encoded thereinto is provided. The video data stream comprises an indication that indicates whether or not one or more scalable nesting supplemental enhancement information messages comprising timing information for each of one or more output layer sets are present within the video data stream.</p>
            </abstract>
